          "created_at": "2024-07-04T10:47:24.000Z",
          "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/original/4X/f/2/d/f2da7379a826d6b3c66f4f44b92ad730bf707280.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/yEnzMrv5u5ttAH8B2DbpC9q5Z4Y.png?dl=1\" title=\"luannguyen_2-1720089633280.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/original/4X/f/2/d/f2da7379a826d6b3c66f4f44b92ad730bf707280.png\" alt=\"luannguyen_2-1720089633280.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"yEnzMrv5u5ttAH8B2DbpC9q5Z4Y\" width=\"690\" height=\"263\" data-dominant-color=\"EDEEEC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">luannguyen_2-1720089633280.png</span><span class=\"informations\">1898×724 60 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/original/3X/0/9/092cfd3e123d74af1712a35bf3c4150edf19d959.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/1jaGxNmRPvFy4HPBRnMlyIVQ9nP.png?dl=1\" title=\"luannguyen_3-1720089668045.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/original/3X/0/9/092cfd3e123d74af1712a35bf3c4150edf19d959.png\" alt=\"luannguyen_3-1720089668045.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"1jaGxNmRPvFy4HPBRnMlyIVQ9nP\" width=\"690\" height=\"258\" data-dominant-color=\"E9E9E8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">luannguyen_3-1720089668045.png</span><span class=\"informations\">1849×693 76.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Hello everyone, can a Shopify admin explain to me why the CSV file of an order in Shopify shows data for 3 products in one order, but columns D, E,…O in rows 27, 28 are empty? Is it because Shopify considers those rows as duplicates of the columns in row 26? In Shoppe’s data, an order with 3 products still fills out all the columns. Please help clarify this for me. Thank you for reading.</p>",
